  "id": "incremental-theory",
  "term": "incremental theory",
  "definition": "Incremental theory is the view, used here in personality interventions, that people can change. In adolescents, teaching this idea has been linked with less bullying and cyberbullying and a weaker link between being victimized and later bullying others.",
